              <name>ECCSEFAR</name>
              <description>ECC Single Error Fault Address Register\nWhen FMC detects a ECCSEBCF would record fault address at the register.The register is cleared by writing 1 to ECCSEBCF.ECCSEFAR is 64 bit alignment so ECCSEFAR[2:0] are always 0.</description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>32</bitWidth>
            </field>
