          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>PSCNT0</name>
              <description>EPWM Trigger EADC Prescale Counter 0\nUser can monitor PSCNT0 to know the current value in 4-bit trigger EADC prescale counter.\nNote 1: user can write only when PSCEN0 is 0.\nNote 2: Write data limitation: PSCNT0 &lt; EADCPSC0.</description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>4</bitWidth>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>PSCNT1</name>
              <description>EPWM Trigger EADC Prescale Counter 1\nUser can monitor PSCNT1 to know the current value in 4-bit trigger EADC prescale counter.\nNote 1: user can write only when PSCEN1 is 0.\nNote 2: Write data limitation: PSCNT1 &lt; EADCPSC1.</description>
