              <name>SELFTEST</name>
              <description>EPWM Self-test Mode Enable (Write Protect)\nWhen EPWM self-test mode enabled, the EPWM_CH0 capture input source comes from EPWM_CH1 output, and EPWM_CH1 capture input source comes from EPWM_CH0 output. So as the EPWM pair EPWM_CH2/3 and EPWM_CH4/5.\nNote: This bit is write protected. Refer to&#160;SYS_REGLCTL register.</description>
