              <description>BPWM Self-test Mode Enable Bit(Write Protect)\nWhen BPWM self-test mode enabled, the BPWM0 capture input source comes from BPWM1 output, and BPWM1 capture input source comes from BPWM0 output. \nNote: This bit is write protected. Refer to&#160;SYS_REGLCTL register.</description>
